{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0098_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0098_story_03_title", "source_sha256": "4d592664effccffe424a9ea8405996f6bf88579c1e2c8ea7bdfae29ef7fd43e0", "ja": "誘惑の小悪魔♡", "zh": "诱惑的小恶魔♡", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0098_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0098_story_03_synopsis", "source_sha256": "2fa451b1815e0785580e0a3c03dba80e49ab2826ab44f1e22247c89977f35831", "ja": "見事な小悪魔演技を披露する美希。次はいよ\nいよ雪歩が挑戦することに。なんとか演じよ\nうとする雪歩だが、プロデューサーを前に、\n緊張のあまりダウンしてしまう。その時、こ\nのみと莉緒が乱入して……。", "zh": "美希完美展现出小恶魔般的演技后，\n接着终于轮到雪步挑战。\n雪步努力想演绎好角色，\n却因为在制作人面前太过紧张而倒下。\n就在这时，木实和莉绪突然闯入……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0098_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0098_story_03_1003_003mik", "source_sha256": "55258f65e0e7beab411b8c813fa38b640c57004a63665d9fc4ad3fd65bfd9bde", "ja": "それじゃあ……、あのね。ミキ、ハニーのことで、\nいつもいっぱいなの。だから……。", "zh": "那么……跟你说喔，\n美希心中总是满满的都是HONEY，所以呀……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0098_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0098_story_03_1004_003mik", "source_sha256": "afaac89006629377c38e6c6c7131ec19e630ec024b12e68add8d6d6a60c2b9f7", "ja": "ハニーも、ミキでいっぱいに……してあげる♪\nあはっ☆", "zh": "美希也要让HONEY的内心……被美希填满♪\n啊哈☆", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
