{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0098_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0098_story_03_2000_p", "source_sha256": "6f9d1cd5b880fce85c112e815acf8236c0af050c888b359374311183d811e0b0", "ja": "（さすが美希というか……。\nとにかく気を落ち着けよう！）", "zh": "（真不愧是美希……\n总之先冷静下来吧！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0098_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0098_story_03_2001_p", "source_sha256": "3def02a311356d923416837eaeac39506ab0521055c177a2529179ab5de4143f", "ja": "え～と……うん、いい感じだな。ははは！\nところで美希、こういう場所で、その呼び方は……。", "zh": "这个嘛～嗯，感觉很不错，哈哈哈！\n话说回来，美希，不要在这种地方用那个称呼……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0098_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0098_story_03_2002_003mik", "source_sha256": "ef850c3fb78f58d1a97d7ed687dac7ce5ba4200c45d1562967178eb3f2d54c9e", "ja": "もちろん、演技だよ？\nでも、ホンキになっちゃったかも。あはっ☆", "zh": "这当然只是演戏喔？\n不过，或许也有动真情呢，啊哈☆", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0098_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0098_story_03_2003_006mak", "source_sha256": "ce5fac3dd32215b1e9e9f433be8f0531830716b877aa83d773867885ac06a134", "ja": "たったふた言で、空気が変わったよね。\nなんていうか、ビックリしたよ……。", "zh": "光靠两句话，就让整个气氛都不一样了。\n该怎么说，真让人吃惊……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0098_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0098_story_03_2004_007ior", "source_sha256": "4c3c8d74f4dc0d054b28002840b193bc7d91b1a7da95d2128f977e2b257b5334", "ja": "小悪魔っていうより、ただの悪魔じゃないかしら？", "zh": "与其说是小恶魔，不如说根本就是恶魔吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0098_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0098_story_03_2005_003mik", "source_sha256": "42265dbd307b2b95a40320d513400ea3567df593cc8ceca018c9f6a19c17ce0e", "ja": "むー。ミキ、そんなに悪い子じゃないよ？\nでこちゃんは失礼なの。", "zh": "唔～美希才没有那么坏呢。\n额头妹真没礼貌。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0098_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0098_story_03_2006_007ior", "source_sha256": "e577bad5f187d2dbc589dc0cc74746f5a00eb29a9a95f3306c26cdc1e4b12409", "ja": "でこちゃん言うなっ。\nアンタの方が失礼じゃない！", "zh": "别叫我额头妹，\n没礼貌的人是你吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0098_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0098_story_03_2007_004yuk", "source_sha256": "f7d0ac0d414d416e884d10e7987c1b2b9ae5bb5b20680adfd75e9d0e2db40d61", "ja": "はぁ……。みんな、すごいなぁ。\n私には絶対、無理……。", "zh": "唉……大家都好厉害。\n这种事我绝对办不到……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0098_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0098_story_03_2008_007ior", "source_sha256": "f7b5afac8d26b1ea915afb94abea381a8032bf3ebab8487d380a9287f42adbde", "ja": "とにかく、次は雪歩の番ね♪", "zh": "总之，接下来轮到雪步啰♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0098_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0098_story_03_2009_004yuk", "source_sha256": "11ea1e92d2398604d85e271de66dfd4b99f0a715800afa7e836da7d3498b0daa", "ja": "えええっ！？　わ、私もやるの？", "zh": "咦咦咦！？我、我也要挑战吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0098_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0098_story_03_2010_007ior", "source_sha256": "ec1f1bf55d47c2e87779fba9c506d0e1e34f2a67f6d3decefe9171f071259efb", "ja": "あら、なんのためのお手本だと思ってたの？\nさあ、手加減ナシで、思いっきり誘惑してみなさい！", "zh": "哎呀，你以为我们是为了谁在做示范？\n来吧，别手下留情，尽情诱惑他吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0098_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0098_story_03_2011_004yuk", "source_sha256": "14c87e60a53ebb3320963ca4375cf3658a6f062c35e70d476b48565831013036", "ja": "で、でも私、相手が{$P$}だと、\nよ、よけいにドキドキしちゃうっていうか……！", "zh": "但、但是，如果对象是{$P$}，\n反、反而会让我更紧张……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0098_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0098_story_03_2012_007ior", "source_sha256": "37aa3947ebb8dca490495b702b4b6cc8af7eb0f6898d1f85c90d6f1e30743722", "ja": "だったら、石ころか電柱だと思えばいいのっ。\nカンタンでしょ？", "zh": "那把他当成石头或电线杆就好啦。\n很简单吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0098_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0098_story_03_2013_p", "source_sha256": "934f4bcd233cd1995a146921fccf9ab2dd38dd47bd01ebb514e90f9f27bdd3d3", "ja": "簡単なのか？", "zh": "这算简单吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0098_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0098_story_03_2014_006mak", "source_sha256": "ebc282d102b66ca95118ec17ee0a44d5426b4c463afa7fa0d27dc0a92aab6c1e", "ja": "雪歩、せっかくだからやってみようよ。\nがんばって！", "zh": "雪步，机会难得，你就试试看嘛。\n加油！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0098_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0098_story_03_2015_003mik", "source_sha256": "b1176a69952c296601a9c666aa91bed4b2b3978b76e0c7ee9a4645274a785648", "ja": "ほら、{$P$}も、\n雪歩に誘惑されたいって♪", "zh": "连{$P$}也说他想被雪步诱惑喔♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0098_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0098_story_03_2016_p", "source_sha256": "f49dd168e2e4151189c528513fde42bae8475967df941f67ef302ad20f8d8662", "ja": "いってないけど……まあ、流れ的にな。\nなんなら後ろを向いていようか？", "zh": "我没这么说……不过，照顺序来看的确是轮到雪步了。\n要不要我背对着你？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0098_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0098_story_03_2017_004yuk", "source_sha256": "c69720ae23054d7b867a5e5e75b9225f8f5447dc1d40cf2963d3038f494777dd", "ja": "あ……い、いえ、大丈夫ですぅ。\nわ、私……小悪魔、やってみますねっ。", "zh": "啊……不、不用，我可以的。\n我、我……要试着扮演小恶魔啰。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0098_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0098_story_03_2018_004yuk", "source_sha256": "5bec02dbf0c0b5125c504de20be1d70941faf6198577d049dfd282d08809e76e", "ja": "あ、あの……、{$P$}？\nあの……、その……。はぁ、はぁ……。", "zh": "那、那个……{$P$}？\n那个……就是……呼、呼……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0098_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0098_story_03_2019_004yuk", "source_sha256": "ffc3d6816cb8fe42619349606cb2911ce5c56a5dc8236f251f1404cac070b230", "ja": "私、いっぱいドキドキしちゃってますけど……。\nで、でも、私のこと……私のこと……！", "zh": "虽然我现在心跳得非常快……\n但、但是，我……我……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
